WEBVTT

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.270
Can I have these?

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:07.590
Very well.

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:11.740
That's one three-person friendship to go!

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:13.450
Here you go.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.910
I hope you guys make up.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:19.000
Yeah.

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:28.500
I need to tell the others.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.130
If the three of us run Park 
together, I know we can...

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:38.760
Why?

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:15.630
<i>More... More power...</i>

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:17.270
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:19.220
<i>I want to be together forever, Mari-chan.</i>

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:26.240
No!

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:28.840
Mari, Kotoko!

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:30.520
You'll turn into Scoopers!

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:32.380
I don't care.

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:36.100
I'd rather become a Scooper 
than lose all my followers.

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:39.140
I need to be with Mari.

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:43.110
I want to become a Scooper so we can 
enjoy an eternal spring break together.

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:44.240
We are together.

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:47.670
We can keep running Park 
the way we have been.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.670
As long as we keep running Park...

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:53.670
It's too late.

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:58.180
At this rate, no one will follow me.

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:01.140
I need more recognition.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.110
I'll become a Scooper and steal popularity.

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:47.760
Please, stop, you two.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.790
What's wrong, Rito-chan?

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:52.750
Sayumin.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.670
Did Kotoko-chan and Mari-chan 
eat the sakuramochi?

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:04.130
Sorry, I...

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:08.600
Huh? Did you drop them?

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.670
Here.

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:12.480
You can eat this and make up.

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:13.850
Sayumin...

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:15.190
It's okay.

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:19.320
It's a new kind of crêpe.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:22.270
I want you three to eat it.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:24.410
Thanks.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:28.020
Mari, Kotoko. Sayumin made this for...

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:33.650
Is this...

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:47.090
It's a very mysterious sweet.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.560
If you eat it, it'll make 
all your wishes come true.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:51.740
No...

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:54.030
That can't be.

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.470
It's true.

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:57.020
Just try some.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:04:59.520
Go on.

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:01.380
No.

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:02.480
Just eat it.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.610
No, Sayumin.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.430
Give some to me.

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:09.030
Me, too.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:12.740
Eating this will grant any wish, right?

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:13.270
Yeah.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:14.900
Thank you, Sayumin.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:17.130
Mari, Kotoko, don't eat it.

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:20.640
That's made from the Scoopers we've defeated.

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:23.870
If you eat it, you'll become 
even more of a Scooper.

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:24.980
Oh, really?

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.880
But why does Sayumin have this?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.220
Right? That doesn't make sense either, does it?

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:32.920
I don't want to think right now.

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:35.560
I'll do anything for more followers.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:40.260
I don't care anymore, either, 
as long as we can be together.

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:41.190
Pull yourselves together.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:42.320
Mari, Kotoko.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:43.280
Don't touch me!

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:51.700
I'm getting my popularity and followers back.

00:05:54.490 --> 00:05:56.110
Can't you hear them?

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:58.830
They're cheering for me.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.020
I can't hear them.

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.980
I don't hear them, Mari.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:04.510
Rito-chan, have some with us.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:05.510
Kotoko.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.280
Why are you making that face?

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:11.010
I want to see you and Mari-chan smile.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:15.180
Kotoko, you look like 
you're about to cry, too.

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:21.400
Nobody ever acknowledged me before.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:24.080
They wouldn't even look at me.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:31.410
But you and Mari-chan called me 
interesting, and you were my friends.

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:37.090
Since you're my first friends, 
I want to be together forever.

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:39.320
I don't want to be alone anymore.

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:44.170
So if Mari-chan's becoming 
a Scooper, I will, too.

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:51.170
I'm able to draw because of 
you and your praise, too.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:55.930
So let's keep running Park 
the way we have been.

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:57.950
Right, Mari?

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:01.800
I told you, it's too late.

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:03.330
It's not too late.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:06.280
As long as we work together, it'll be okay.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:09.130
As long as we're together, 
we can make anything.

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:10.150
We can't.

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:14.200
Unlike you, all I can do is copy others.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.410
Now, now. Calm down.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.810
Don't cry.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:21.330
It's good, isn't it?

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.670
I'm sure it'll cheer you up.

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:24.750
Oh, Mari-chan.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:28.920
If you eat lots of this sweet, 
you'll become a popular idol.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.120
Really?

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:30.760
Really.

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:32.830
Sayumin...

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:33.970
Give me more!

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.300
You're right.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:41.760
I can hear their voices 
even more clearly now.

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:43.200
How wonderful.

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:48.040
Walking the red carpet in 
Hollywood feels amazing.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.800
Sayumin, thank you.

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.770
You're wonderful, Mari-chan.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:55.740
Sayumin...

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:58.280
Are you really Sayumin?

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:00.660
Sure I am.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:01.460
Why?

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:05.010
Is it good, Kotoko-chan?

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:05.650
Yeah.

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:07.480
Have more, then.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:12.760
If you keep eating, the three 
of you can be together forever.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:13.840
Really?

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:14.590
Really.

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.310
I'm so glad.

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:18.690
It's delicious!

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:23.990
Now you can be with them forever.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.870
Thank you, Sayumin.

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.140
What a wonderful smile, Kotoko-chan.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:31.490
Rito-chan, have some.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:35.360
I don't want any.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:39.040
Why not? Don't you want to 
make up with your friends?

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.330
Look at them.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.540
Don't their expressions look wonderful?

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:50.500
If you eat this, you'll be 
able to make up with them.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:55.470
You'll be friends again.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.360
Really?

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:01.110
Really.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.270
Can I trust you?

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:07.690
Of course.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.720
Go ahead.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:12.440
I can't!

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:16.100
Why not, Rito-chan?

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.180
What is this?

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.160
What's happening?

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:23.700
Sayumin...

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:30.110
Could it be?

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:33.010
Mari-chan, Kotoko-chan.

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:37.720
You made cute things, but you 
were just copying what's popular.

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:42.470
Nothing you sold at Park was original.

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.750
But there's nothing wrong with that!

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.820
It was fun, right?

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.130
If you're going to do that anyway,

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:52.900
it'll be even easier to have 
fun if you become Scoopers.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.040
That's right.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:56.500
I'll become a Scooper and steal popularity.

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:57.740
Me, too.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:02.260
We'll be together forever and fill 
the world with things that we like.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:11.290
Isn't becoming a Scooper the best?

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:15.260
Rito-chan, you should become one, too!

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:18.440
No.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:19.890
Rito-chan?

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.720
I don't want that.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:24.180
We don't need to become Scoopers.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.680
We just need Park.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:29.170
Mari, if we work hard together at Park,

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:31.050
I'm sure everyone will look at you.

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:33.590
Your followers will come back.

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:37.150
Kotoko, let's run Park together forever.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.160
Let's make Park even bigger than it is.

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:42.490
Let's be creative together!

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:48.220
So don't say you'll become Scoopers anymore.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.170
Oh, come on.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.960
Rito-chan, why don't you understand?

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:57.940
Once you become Scoopers, 
you won't need Park anymore.

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:02.390
How can I get you to understand?

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.100
I know!

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.100
You refuse to understand because of Park.

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.660
I should just get rid of Park.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:12.520
Yeah.

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:31.440
Sayumin? What are you planning?

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:32.870
I'm going to destroy Park.

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:36.340
No! Don't!

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:39.800
Please don't destroy Park!

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:41.440
I have to.

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:45.260
If I don't take Park away from 
you, you won't understand.

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:46.510
Listen to me!

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:47.710
Sayumin!

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.470
Stay out of my way.

00:11:58.450 --> 00:11:59.630
Sayumin...

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:05.550
You just wait, Rito-chan.

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:07.200
I'll make everything better for you.

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.450
Stop! Please!

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.030
If you don't, I...

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:27.920
Sayumin, please stop.

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:30.270
I don't want to do this, either.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.740
Why, Rito-chan?

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:33.190
Why won't you understand?

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:35.580
I can't.

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:37.400
They understand.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:41.090
Rito-chan, why are you doing that to Sayumin?

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:42.950
Sayumin is our friend.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:45.280
Why are you fighting her?

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:46.580
Stop, Rito.

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:49.890
If you listen to Sayumin, 
you can become an idol.

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:52.150
No! That's not how it works!

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:53.540
That's not Sayumin.

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:55.400
Sayumin...

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:59.250
The real Sayumin would never say that.

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:00.670
That's Sayumin.

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:04.820
She's trying to do what's best for us.

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:08.390
There's no need to fight.

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:11.140
Let go! Park is going to be destroyed!

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.960
No! I won't let go!

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:15.750
Rito, I'm going to be an idol.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.740
I need Sayumin's sweets to do that.

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:20.500
Listen to Sayumin.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.280
I don't understand! 
I don't understand at all!

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:27.110
Eat this, and you'll understand everything.

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:29.570
Rito-chan, eat.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:33.220
Rito-chan, we'll eat it with you.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:37.540
Rito, don't you want more 
fans to look at your art?

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:39.760
You have to eat.

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:42.830
It's really sweet and tasty.

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:45.700
Eat, and we'll be together forever.

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:46.690
I don't want it.

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:48.620
I don't want that!

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:53.370
But if you don't eat, you'll really be alone.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:57.010
Then no one will look at your art.

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:03.990
Rito-chan, you always drew alone, 
without praise from anyone.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:09.860
Who will look at your 
drawings when you're alone?

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:11.700
Who will love them?

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.720
I...

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:17.210
No one looked at them when 
you were alone, remember?

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:24.210
Nobody noticed.

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:41.810
They seem sad.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:43.540
What are you talking about?

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:45.860
This is our chance, Misa-sama.

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:53.860
Rito-chan.

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:54.550
Rito.

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:55.790
Rito-chan, join us.

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.540
Eat it, and you won't be alone anymore.

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:04.320
If you only draw what you want to draw,

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:06.550
eventually no one will look at your work.

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:12.150
You need more people to see 
your drawings and praise them.

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:15.210
And you can't do that if you stay in Park.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:20.140
So... let's destroy Park together.

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:22.020
No!

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:25.320
I want to be creative at Park together!

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:27.440
Stop!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.020
That hurts, Rito-chan.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.100
Don't do it.

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:35.080
Move.

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.280
Stay back!

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:40.980
I'm destroying Park for the three of you.

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:45.340
No! That's not what we want!

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.130
Ow!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.040
What are you doing? Stop.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:51.930
I won't let you.

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:55.850
That's enough, Rito-chan.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:10.320
Don't.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.030
I won't let you destroy Park!

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.140
Stay out of my way, Rito-chan.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:35.720
Rito-chan.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:40.180
I want us to be creative here together.

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:47.610
As long as we have Park, 
we can create together.

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:51.090
Stop!

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:51.820
Rito.

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:54.950
Why are you doing this to Sayumin?

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:55.910
You're scaring me.

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:58.870
That's not Sayumin!

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.290
I won't let you destroy Park.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:14.260
I want us to keep creating at Park together!

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:18.220
No!

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:43.000
You're so mean, Rito-chan.

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:15.240
Kotoko, Mari.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.660
What's wrong?

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.700
Why did you kill Sayumin?

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.630
You murderer!

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:28.180
But...

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:30.130
But if I didn't, then Park...

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:32.260
Who cares about Park?

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:35.150
All we can do is copy!

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:36.710
Besides, look at this!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:41.450
How awful! The city's a mess!

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:43.510
Do you only care about protecting Park?

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:46.360
You don't care about us!

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:49.510
No. You're wrong.

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:53.040
How could you do this?

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:55.760
Everyone was cheering for me!

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:57.310
You ruined everything, Rito!

00:18:57.310 --> 00:18:58.990
You're wrong!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.360
I'm not wrong.

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:03.220
I don't want to go home or back to school.

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:06.020
I want to do the things we like together.

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:08.690
I don't care about Park anymore.

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:10.330
That's not true!

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:13.270
Without Park, we...

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:20.180
We wanted to make cute things.

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:22.270
We had fun doing it.

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:26.690
So we started Park together.

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:32.800
Isn't Park supposed to be more 
important to us than anything?

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.900
This will never work.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:40.080
No one will support me anymore.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:42.130
I need more power.

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:43.360
You're right.

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:45.070
I need to get it back.

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:48.020
My cuteness, my popularity...

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:52.770
I want to do the things 
we like together forever.

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:55.000
So I'll eat, too.

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:57.700
Why?

00:19:58.330 --> 00:19:59.590
You two...

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:10.370
You're here.

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:14.920
You're warm.

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:20.450
Sayumin's gone.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:23.880
Kotoko and Mari have gone far away, too.

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:29.280
What should I do?

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:32.620
You're all alone now.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:39.050
Aren't they your friends?

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:45.040
Shouldn't you do what you can for them?

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:48.010
For them...

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:00.080
Kotoko...

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:01.680
Mari...

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:05.000
Drawing alone, looking 
at your drawings alone.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:07.280
Is that the life you want to go back to?

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:10.030
No! Anything but that!

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:13.440
Fine! I'll become a Scooper, too!

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:19.960
Rito-chan.

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:20.800
Rito.

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:24.500
Great. Now we'll be together forever.

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:26.180
You understand now, Rito.

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:29.500
Still, I'll keep drawing.

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:32.640
Even if I become a Scooper, 
I'll keep on being creative.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.640
Because I love doing it.

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:27.700
Misa-sama, what are you looking at?

00:23:27.700 --> 00:23:29.320
A fashion magazine that I'm in.

00:23:29.320 --> 00:23:32.340
What? You mean the street corner 
snapshot that was taken the other day?

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:33.010
Let me see.

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:34.970
"The fried shrimp accessory 
makes a cute accent?"

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:36.970
Ebifurya, they think you're an accessory.

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Illustrated by Chikuwa Mieru</b>
